# Phase 1 of the move to /was (docs/features/landing-page/design.md Q7): requests outside /was go to
# the /was app, so this image also works behind an old web (which proxies / to the WAS) and with the
# old / probes. Stable and canary share manifests, so either image must fit them during a canary and
# an image-only rollback. Removed in phase 2, together with the probe change to /was/.
RewriteCond %{REQUEST_URI} !^/was(/.*)?$
RewriteRule ^/(.*)$ /was/$1
